{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54542","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军善（一作「位」），识得（一作「善识」）气妖祥。\n风角鸟云能总解，机[筹]（策）谋略[又]（应）（均从辛本改）相当，取胜应功良（一作「征讨又功强」）。\n（按：此首又重见于「观气色」一首之後，今删去，异文注爲「一作」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}